WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.730
Good news – and gold drops? There's a reason.

00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:09.610
Three drivers move gold: the dollar, rates and uncertainty.

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:14.230
Step one: when the dollar rises, gold often falls.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:19.820
Step two: gold pays no interest. When rates fall, gold wins.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:24.390
Step three: in a crisis, investors flee into gold.

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:29.430
Common mistake: chart only, no news. They belong together.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:33.030
No time to track all of this yourself?

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.470
I explain it live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
